# Frontend Module Structure (Next.js App Router)

For any new feature/module `<module>`:

- UI components: `frontend/components/<module>/`
- Hooks: `frontend/hooks/use-<module>.ts` (or `frontend/hooks/<module>/...`)
- Types: `frontend/types/<module>/...` OR `frontend/types/api/...` for API shapes
- API client code: `frontend/lib/api/<module>.ts` (or the closest existing `lib/api/*` file)
- Next routes/pages: `frontend/app/<route>/page.tsx` (route groups under `frontend/app/(...)/`)

# PPT Frontend (avoid duplicate entrypoints)

- Keep PPT UI in `frontend/components/properties/ppt-generation/`.
- Before creating another `generate-ppt-button.tsx` anywhere else, check existing imports:
  - `frontend/components/properties/property-detail-content.tsx`
  - `frontend/components/properties/index.ts`

